{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103154148737-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103161240\"/><p>美輪閣一單位起火。(陳嘉傑攝)</p><p>今午(3日)3時16分，九龍塘廣播道42號美輪閣一單位失火，冒出大量濃煙，街坊見狀報案。消防趕至將火救熄，經初步調查後，相信有雜物起火，起因有待調查。事件中，約50名住戶需要疏散。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.276948+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:41:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:19:07.451821+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:19:07.451821+00:00","content_hash":"e4e5ec4319a85f777398a144f038707f1b9a96b9ee702f2803620a0fcc332956","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}